              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜ ಕಷ್ಟದಲ್ಲೂ ಘನತೆಯಿಂದ ಬದುಕಿದರು. ajja kaṣṭadallū ghanateyinda badukidaru. Grandfather lived with dignity even in hardship."
            },
